kanfei (0.1.0~beta24) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: corrects three station-computed values read from Davis Vantage
    stations.  Heat index, wind chill and the THSW index were each read one
    byte early from the console's data packet, so the values were assembled
    from adjacent fields and were not readings at all.  The "no sensor
    fitted" marker for these fields was also being tested against the wrong
    value, so it was never recognised — a Vantage Vue, which has no solar
    sensor and therefore cannot compute a THSW index, reported an
    implausible -256 rather than no value.  This was only reachable from
    beta23 onward, since the packet carrying these fields had never
    previously arrived, and the affected values are not yet shown anywhere
    in the interface; the dew point, heat index and wind chill on the
    dashboard are calculated independently and were never affected.

